00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.900
that you can have great instincts.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:21.660
If you have been well-trained, you can have
acquired expertize at something.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:27.899
So if you are the Formula One driver, your
your instincts to drive a Formula One car

00:14:27.899 --> 00:14:34.320
are extraordinarily fine, extraordinarily
