00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.830
And that creates variability.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:17.290
That is not the case in the example you were
talking about, where presumably there are

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.190
maybe humans who are better than machines.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:22.860
That will remain the case for a long time
