00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.240
Speaker 1: So those it's really a different
category altogether.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:28.260
Speaker 5: Yes.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:33.220
And there will be we I don't want to give
the impression that that machines are the

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.519
